2568:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls12_client.c ****      * In the subsequent code there are two paths that read from buf:
2569:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls12_client.c ****      *     * the length of the signature algorithms field (if minor version of
2570:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls12_client.c ****      *       SSL is 3),
