2592:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls12_client.c ****      *     max(i) = sig_alg_len - 1.
2593:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls12_client.c ****      * Therefore the furthest access is:
