1267:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h **** /**
1268:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * \brief Given an SSL context and its associated configuration, write the TLS
1269:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *        1.2 specific extensions of the ClientHello message.
